WEBVTT

00:07.390 --> 00:08.160
Haru!

00:08.160 --> 00:09.360
- Miharu Ayase...
- Don't go!

00:09.910 --> 00:11.730
- ...was Haruto Amakawa's childhood friend.
- I'm not going that far,

00:11.730 --> 00:12.320
- ...was Haruto Amakawa's childhood friend.
- we can still meet again.

00:12.320 --> 00:12.930
- we can still meet again.

00:12.930 --> 00:13.510
- They lived next to each other
- we can still meet again.

00:13.510 --> 00:13.930
- They lived next to each other
- No! Don't go, Haru!

00:13.930 --> 00:15.270
- in the same mansion,
- No! Don't go, Haru!

00:15.270 --> 00:17.280
- but Haruto's parents got divorced.
- No! Don't go, Haru!

00:17.280 --> 00:19.390
- Before Haruto and Miharu parted ways,
- Don't go...

00:19.390 --> 00:21.150
- They grew up together.
- No...

00:21.150 --> 00:21.890
- They grew up together.
- When I grow up, I'll be back!

00:21.890 --> 00:23.940
- Which is why, at that time...
- When I grow up, I'll be back!

00:23.940 --> 00:25.370
- They already thought
- Let's get married by then!

00:25.370 --> 00:27.010
- of each other as someone special.
- Let's get married by then!

00:27.010 --> 00:28.220
- of each other as someone special.
- Then we can be together,

00:28.220 --> 00:29.090
- Then we can be together,

00:29.090 --> 00:30.390
and you can stay by my side!

00:30.390 --> 00:32.710
I will! I will!

00:33.100 --> 00:35.130
I'll marry you!

00:35.590 --> 00:36.390
And they...

00:36.930 --> 00:38.480
...exchanged a promise.

00:42.270 --> 00:44.810
INABA UNIVERSITY HIGH SCHOOL
That's why I studied hard,

00:44.810 --> 00:47.110
OPENING CEREMONY
and put in maximum effort...

00:47.660 --> 00:51.200
...to get to the famous high school
where Miharu lives.

00:51.610 --> 00:52.320
CHEMISTRY CLUB ACCEPTING MEMBERS!

00:52.320 --> 00:54.370
CHEMISTRY CLUB ACCEPTING MEMBERS!
Though, I won't have time for any clubs.

00:55.370 --> 00:57.010
PART-TIME JOB PERMISSION REQUEST
I forced my way

00:57.010 --> 00:59.120
PART-TIME JOB PERMISSION REQUEST
to come back here against Dad's wish.

00:59.120 --> 01:01.820
I gotta earn my own keep to survive.

01:06.870 --> 01:08.070
Miharu!

01:08.070 --> 01:09.650
Hey, Miharu!

01:09.650 --> 01:11.220
Oh, Takahisa.

01:11.570 --> 01:12.770
Did you wait?

01:12.770 --> 01:15.890
No, I just came here.

01:15.890 --> 01:16.560
I see.

01:17.040 --> 01:18.680
Shall we go now?

01:18.680 --> 01:21.190
Hey, Takahisa!

01:22.820 --> 01:26.810
Have you forgotten that
you came here with me?

01:26.810 --> 01:30.780
Satsuki, no way.

01:31.150 --> 01:34.750
You ran off on your own
once you spotted Miharu...

01:34.750 --> 01:37.380
You haven't changed since middle school.

01:38.770 --> 01:40.700
We're keeping Aki and Masato waiting now.

01:40.700 --> 01:41.830
Come on.

01:55.540 --> 01:56.430
Oh!

01:56.750 --> 01:57.850
Bro!

01:57.850 --> 01:58.680
Aki.

01:59.260 --> 02:01.520
Been a while, Sis Satsuki.

02:01.520 --> 02:03.710
Long time no see, Miss Satsuki!

02:03.710 --> 02:06.900
Wow, you've grown taller, you two!

02:07.280 --> 02:10.530
You too, Sis Satsuki!
You've become prettier!

02:11.930 --> 02:14.820
You say the nicest things, Masato!

02:15.260 --> 02:18.850
All right, lunch today's on me as your senior!

02:18.850 --> 02:22.160
Miharu and Takahisa have
become high schoolers today.

02:22.160 --> 02:24.550
And Aki has become
a middle schooler.

02:24.550 --> 02:28.840
Not to mention,
Masato has become a sixth grader too!

02:29.230 --> 02:31.500
Let's celebrate it all!

02:31.500 --> 02:35.230
Yay! Thanks, Sis Satsuki!

02:35.230 --> 02:37.850
You should have some reservations!

02:45.630 --> 02:46.730
What?!

03:11.220 --> 03:12.300
Aishia?

03:13.840 --> 03:16.470
Haruto, please save them!

03:16.900 --> 03:17.570
Huh?

03:34.990 --> 03:37.530
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

04:38.130 --> 04:39.060
Let's go to sleep...

04:41.970 --> 04:45.680
Wh-Wh-What are you guys doing?!

04:48.600 --> 04:52.020
I MET YOU IN THIS WORLD

04:52.380 --> 04:54.370
Masato, where are we?

04:54.370 --> 04:55.530
Don't ask me.

04:56.030 --> 05:01.280
Um, anyway, let's check where we are.

05:02.050 --> 05:03.260
No signal...

05:08.950 --> 05:11.340
Is this the right way, Aishia?

05:11.340 --> 05:13.960
Yes, keep going southeast.

05:27.610 --> 05:28.550
What?

05:28.910 --> 05:31.020
Did they use a spatial spell?

05:39.430 --> 05:40.820
This is...

05:42.410 --> 05:44.930
What's going on here?

05:53.630 --> 05:55.060
- Let go!
- Stop!

05:55.060 --> 05:55.830
- It hurts!
- Stop!

05:55.830 --> 05:56.990
What are you doing?!

05:56.990 --> 05:58.380
Sis Aki!

06:00.630 --> 06:03.910
Please, let them go!

06:03.910 --> 06:05.300
I beg you!

06:05.300 --> 06:08.010
What are you even saying?

06:08.010 --> 06:08.720
Come!

06:09.050 --> 06:10.100
You belong here.

06:10.650 --> 06:11.850
Stop...

06:11.850 --> 06:14.130
What are you doing to her?!

06:14.130 --> 06:16.020
Sis Miharu!

06:17.400 --> 06:19.480
Shut up! Don't you scream!

06:20.410 --> 06:23.930
I think we shouldn't cause a fuss.

06:23.930 --> 06:25.490
What are you saying?!

06:32.950 --> 06:33.960
Smoke?

06:34.650 --> 06:35.960
Is someone there?

06:53.070 --> 06:54.600
Huh? What?

06:54.600 --> 06:55.850
What's going on?

07:01.070 --> 07:03.990
I'm looking for
the person who dropped this.

07:03.990 --> 07:05.660
Do you know who it might be?

07:05.660 --> 07:08.660
What's that? I don't know no one.

07:11.130 --> 07:14.820
I guess it won't be wise
to pick a fight here...

07:15.710 --> 07:17.840
I see. Sorry for the intrusion.

07:19.350 --> 07:21.920
Save us! Help!

07:22.360 --> 07:23.790
Shut up!

07:23.790 --> 07:26.940
Sis Aki?! Are you okay?!

07:26.940 --> 07:28.180
Is that Japanese?

07:28.950 --> 07:32.010
Our newest products
are just being too noisy.

07:33.600 --> 07:36.470
She sounds like
the person I'm looking for.

07:36.470 --> 07:39.480
She was screaming for help.
What does that mean?

07:39.480 --> 07:41.750
He can understand their words?!

07:41.750 --> 07:43.230
Tch! Kill him!

07:43.570 --> 07:44.990
All right, do your job!

07:47.260 --> 07:49.330
This is a well-organised movement.

07:49.330 --> 07:51.240
They're used to fighting as a group.

07:51.240 --> 07:53.990
You're mistaking bravery for foolishness, eh?

07:54.340 --> 07:57.500
If you're raring to go,
then I won't hold back.

08:00.330 --> 08:00.790
Tch!

08:04.890 --> 08:06.170
Light Bullet Magic!

08:17.690 --> 08:22.110
I'd love to just capture the leader
and use him as a bargaining chip...

08:22.110 --> 08:23.690
But I guess it won't be that easy.

08:24.070 --> 08:24.940
Oh, fine.

08:37.710 --> 08:38.960
You fool...

08:39.340 --> 08:40.750
Fire Ball Magic!

08:51.010 --> 08:51.930
Gah!

09:17.100 --> 09:19.790
Release the kids you kidnapped.

09:19.790 --> 09:22.820
They won't move unless
you give them an order, right?!

09:23.860 --> 09:25.060
Get on with it!

09:25.060 --> 09:29.380
Let them go! Hurry!

09:33.030 --> 09:34.390
Are you okay?

09:34.390 --> 09:36.890
You can understand Japanese?!

09:37.330 --> 09:40.950
Well, I do... But I'll explain later.

09:40.950 --> 09:43.470
Were you the only ones kidnapped?

09:43.470 --> 09:45.890
There's another one.

09:45.890 --> 09:48.150
She was put inside that carriage.

10:06.700 --> 10:09.090
I'm here to save you.
Are you okay?

10:11.090 --> 10:11.760
Why?!

10:13.410 --> 10:14.760
Why...

10:16.010 --> 10:16.890
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

10:16.890 --> 10:18.530
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2
...are you here?!

10:18.530 --> 10:20.020
SEIREI GENSOUKI - SPIRIT CHRONICLES SEASON 2

10:24.530 --> 10:25.540
Aishia.

10:26.020 --> 10:29.100
I think I've saved the people you mentioned.

10:29.100 --> 10:31.330
Let's regroup before sundown.

10:31.330 --> 10:32.780
Can you tell where I am?

10:33.180 --> 10:36.630
Yeah. I'll get Celia as well.

10:36.630 --> 10:37.780
Thanks.

10:37.780 --> 10:39.290
So pretty...

10:47.590 --> 10:51.050
U-Um, excuse me, may I have a minute?

10:51.590 --> 10:53.050
What is it?

10:53.470 --> 10:57.180
Thank you for saving us.

10:57.180 --> 11:01.710
Had you not come,
who knows what would happen to us.

11:01.710 --> 11:04.820
It's nothing.
I just did what I had to.

11:04.820 --> 11:06.560
Also, I have questions for you...

11:06.560 --> 11:08.560
Questions?

11:08.940 --> 11:09.820
Oh, well...

11:11.060 --> 11:14.630
Um, I'm Miharu Ayase.

11:14.630 --> 11:17.280
May I have your name?

11:17.660 --> 11:18.670
Name?

11:19.070 --> 11:20.280
I...

11:22.160 --> 11:24.570
I have my circumstances,

11:24.570 --> 11:26.980
so I call myself Haruto now.

11:27.620 --> 11:28.920
No surname.

11:29.340 --> 11:30.980
Haruto...

11:32.170 --> 11:33.900
Haruto?

11:33.900 --> 11:35.030
Aki.

11:38.570 --> 11:39.550
Aki?

11:40.240 --> 11:43.520
Haruto also had a sister
who was three years younger.

11:43.520 --> 11:45.680
He hadn't had the chance
to meet her again since,

11:46.380 --> 11:47.520
but is she...

11:48.080 --> 11:50.710
Yeah, she does look familiar.

11:50.710 --> 11:55.210
Besides, Miharu...
she calls her Aki, so it's a solid proof.

11:55.900 --> 11:57.700
Um, err...

11:57.700 --> 12:03.040
Oh, sorry. I just thought you
might be bothered with my name.

12:03.040 --> 12:05.700
Excuse me, it's nothing.

12:06.230 --> 12:10.710
Hey, what do you mean
you have no surname?

12:11.170 --> 12:13.520
Oh, I'm Masato Sendo.

12:13.520 --> 12:15.460
I'm Sis Aki's little brother.

12:16.160 --> 12:18.880
Haruto Amakawa
didn't have a younger brother.

12:19.340 --> 12:21.490
And his surname isn't Amakawa...

12:21.920 --> 12:26.790
If he's Aki's brother, that means
Haruto's mother got remarried?

12:27.990 --> 12:29.110
Little brother...

12:29.830 --> 12:33.230
So you're Aki Sendo?

12:33.650 --> 12:35.610
Yes, that's right.

12:36.130 --> 12:38.740
I'm sorry for the late introduction.

12:39.070 --> 12:42.580
It's okay.
Now, about why I don't have a surname...

12:43.830 --> 12:45.770
It's almost dark, though.

12:46.180 --> 12:49.120
It'll be a long story too,
so let's go somewhere else.

12:49.930 --> 12:52.010
I know a place where we can settle down.

12:52.010 --> 12:52.880
Follow me.

13:15.420 --> 13:17.310
I guess this spot is fine.

13:18.770 --> 13:20.060
Release Magic.

13:24.700 --> 13:27.020
What is that?

13:30.300 --> 13:32.370
It looks like a rock from the outside,

13:32.740 --> 13:35.360
but it has a proper living space inside.

13:35.360 --> 13:36.570
This way.

13:36.570 --> 13:38.210
Rio!

13:38.540 --> 13:39.050
Huh?!

13:39.050 --> 13:40.980
They're flying!

13:48.890 --> 13:51.710
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

13:51.710 --> 13:54.020
I'm okay, Master.

13:55.970 --> 13:57.290
That's a relief...

13:57.290 --> 14:00.790
Are they the children Aishia mentioned?

14:00.790 --> 14:02.330
So you saved them.

14:02.330 --> 14:04.870
Yeah, there's Miharu Ayase,

14:05.280 --> 14:06.380
Aki Sendo,

14:06.890 --> 14:09.620
and her brother, Masato.

14:09.970 --> 14:14.160
I see. I'm Celia. Celia Claire.

14:14.160 --> 14:15.380
Nice to meet you.

14:17.310 --> 14:20.910
This is Master Celia, my saviour.

14:20.910 --> 14:24.130
Pleasure to meet you.

14:24.130 --> 14:26.850
My name is Miharu Ayase.

14:27.790 --> 14:29.500
Um...

14:29.500 --> 14:32.960
They don't speak Strahl.

14:32.960 --> 14:35.270
Oh, is that so...

14:35.270 --> 14:36.460
Celia.

14:45.550 --> 14:47.710
What are you doing?!

14:56.910 --> 14:59.290
What are you doing, Aishia?

14:59.290 --> 15:01.290
Huh? Why?

15:02.340 --> 15:03.790
She's speaking Strahl?

15:03.790 --> 15:06.050
I linked a temporary path between you two.

15:06.050 --> 15:09.460
I'll be temporarily
interpreting between you two.

15:09.460 --> 15:12.750
You can do that, Aishia?

15:12.750 --> 15:15.370
It's a language you know, so I can.

15:15.370 --> 15:17.410
I can't if I don't know the language.

15:17.410 --> 15:18.820
I see.

15:18.820 --> 15:21.440
Haruto, I'm hungry.

15:21.440 --> 15:23.070
Oh, right.

15:23.070 --> 15:26.100
Please, come inside, everyone.

15:27.740 --> 15:30.130
Wow! So beautiful!

15:31.690 --> 15:32.790
So spacious!

15:37.150 --> 15:41.300
Anyway, we also have a bath here,
so feel free to use it.

15:41.680 --> 15:44.020
There's a bath here?
Sweet!

15:44.020 --> 15:46.300
Masato, you're way too energetic.

15:57.730 --> 16:01.730
So Mister Haruto's real name is Rio?

16:02.100 --> 16:06.740
And Miss Aishia is his contract spirit?

16:06.740 --> 16:08.950
Yes, that's right.

16:08.950 --> 16:12.690
But I just met with Aishia today.

16:12.690 --> 16:15.270
I don't really know the details...

16:15.270 --> 16:16.700
Excuse me.

16:17.810 --> 16:20.500
Sis Miharu, what are you talking about?

16:20.890 --> 16:24.410
Miss Aishia is not a human, but a spirit.

16:24.410 --> 16:26.530
Huh? A spirit?!

16:26.530 --> 16:30.010
So that's why she can do
simultaneous interpretation...

16:30.490 --> 16:33.510
Y-Yeah, I think so...

16:36.390 --> 16:38.350
So we...

16:38.350 --> 16:41.810
...actually came to a fantasy RPG world?

16:41.810 --> 16:46.490
I rarely played such game
in my past life, so I'm not sure.

16:47.110 --> 16:49.450
But I think it's close enough.

16:50.250 --> 16:53.660
However, unlike in games,
there's no reset button.

16:54.060 --> 16:59.160
I see... So we would've been in danger
had not you come to rescue us?

16:59.700 --> 17:02.920
Yeah, you would've been slaves by then.

17:03.670 --> 17:05.550
Is that so...

17:05.550 --> 17:09.130
That was a nice bath.
Thank you, Mister Haruto!

17:09.540 --> 17:11.210
That's good to hear.

17:11.910 --> 17:16.590
Rio, I've never been in such a bath,

17:16.590 --> 17:18.980
but it was so good and refreshing!

17:18.980 --> 17:20.520
Why don't you jump in too?

17:21.100 --> 17:23.480
I'll do that after preparing for dinner...

17:28.300 --> 17:29.240
What's that?

17:29.750 --> 17:31.710
Aki lent it to me.

17:31.710 --> 17:35.990
It'll be weird to wear
a wedding dress again after bath, she said.

17:36.820 --> 17:38.000
I see...

17:38.000 --> 17:43.820
It's pretty easy to move in this outfit,
and surprisingly feels so good on the skin!

17:43.820 --> 17:45.760
I've never felt such material.

17:45.760 --> 17:49.100
I just bought the outfit
after the entrance ceremony.

17:49.100 --> 17:51.680
It's not dirty, so I think it'll be okay.

17:52.150 --> 17:53.900
I guess so.

17:53.900 --> 17:56.490
She seems to like it too.

17:56.940 --> 18:00.650
But I guess you can't live
without a change of clothes, right?

18:01.180 --> 18:04.770
Let's buy the needed daily
necessities tomorrow together.

18:05.120 --> 18:08.650
Um, but we don't have money...

18:08.650 --> 18:13.470
Don't worry. I have enough
to at least buy what you need.

18:13.470 --> 18:16.280
But where are you going to buy them, Rio?

18:16.790 --> 18:18.790
What about around Amande?

18:19.180 --> 18:20.510
Amande!

18:20.510 --> 18:24.290
I wonder if I can exchange
my wedding dress for money too?

18:24.660 --> 18:29.910
You don't have to worry about money.

18:29.910 --> 18:32.290
Anyway, let's eat.

18:32.290 --> 18:33.550
Oh, right.

18:34.090 --> 18:37.050
Wow! Did you make all of this?

18:37.450 --> 18:38.480
Yes.

18:38.480 --> 18:41.040
All right, let's have dinner, everyone.

18:45.410 --> 18:49.220
I see... Putting together
what you just told me,

18:49.220 --> 18:52.620
you might have got entangled
in some kind of summon spell,

18:52.620 --> 18:54.990
and transported to this world.

18:55.440 --> 18:59.740
Um, can't we return to Earth?

19:00.210 --> 19:02.290
I don't know about that either.

19:02.780 --> 19:07.500
It's so different from
when I was reincarnated to this world.

19:08.170 --> 19:12.010
You died in a traffic accident
when you were in college,

19:12.010 --> 19:17.300
and when you came to, your memories came back
in a body of a child in this world, right?

19:17.300 --> 19:18.500
Yes.

19:18.500 --> 19:22.020
That's why I don't think my experience
will be useful to you.

19:22.380 --> 19:25.680
Rio, can I speak to them?

19:25.680 --> 19:27.360
Sure, go ahead.

19:27.360 --> 19:29.270
Combining your story,

19:29.730 --> 19:33.280
and the six light pillars we saw today,

19:33.950 --> 19:38.620
and also the fact that it is
the year 1000 of the Holy Era calendar...

19:38.620 --> 19:43.160
Perhaps it has something to do with
the legend of the Six Wise Gods.

19:43.530 --> 19:44.680
Right.

19:44.680 --> 19:46.870
I thought about that too.

19:46.870 --> 19:49.790
1,000 years after the Divine-Demon War.

19:49.790 --> 19:52.260
When the six-colour holy jewels shines,

19:52.260 --> 19:55.350
creating light pillars reaching high to the sky,

19:55.990 --> 19:58.380
the valiant heroes who embrace
the Divine Equipment,

19:58.380 --> 20:00.690
will return to the land of Strahl,

20:00.690 --> 20:05.470
and lead the world of men
on behalf of the Six Wise Gods.

20:06.500 --> 20:12.080
Still, I don't think they're
the heroes spoken in the legends...

20:12.510 --> 20:13.900
What do you think?

20:14.210 --> 20:16.900
You have a point...

20:17.860 --> 20:18.910
Um...

20:18.910 --> 20:19.840
Yes?

20:19.840 --> 20:23.510
There were two people with us
right before we were sent here.

20:23.510 --> 20:26.480
They are Satsuki and Takahisa,
but they disappeared first.

20:26.480 --> 20:28.670
Are they in this world too?

20:29.040 --> 20:30.960
I wonder...

20:30.960 --> 20:34.920
There is a possibility,
but I can't say for sure.

20:35.280 --> 20:36.920
Is that so...

20:37.910 --> 20:40.430
I see you're worried about them.

20:40.430 --> 20:41.780
Yes.

20:41.780 --> 20:47.690
We were just lucky to have you rescue us...

20:47.690 --> 20:51.690
I mean, it's a world where our
common sense doesn't work...

21:00.550 --> 21:03.780
Haruto, I'm sleepy...
Let's go to sleep.

21:03.780 --> 21:07.160
Huh? H-Hey, Aishia...

21:07.530 --> 21:12.380
I can't... I used up too much energy today...

21:16.840 --> 21:20.590
Wh-Wh-What are you guys doing?!

21:20.590 --> 21:22.590
I'm recharging mana.

21:22.590 --> 21:26.350
Wait, wait, wait!
You can't do that!

21:26.350 --> 21:27.850
Why?

21:27.850 --> 21:29.850
Why, you say...

21:29.850 --> 21:32.850
I always sleep with Haruto.

21:33.330 --> 21:34.310
Huh?!

21:35.070 --> 21:38.240
Well, Master, there's an explanation...

21:38.240 --> 21:40.930
Haruto, let's go.

21:41.330 --> 21:43.050
W-Wait!

21:43.050 --> 21:44.800
Y-You...

21:44.800 --> 21:46.740
You haven't taken a bath yet!

21:47.170 --> 21:48.750
Huh? That's your concern?

21:49.220 --> 21:50.500
U-Um...

21:50.850 --> 21:53.750
We'll clean up the table.

21:53.750 --> 21:55.500
Oh, no need to...

21:55.870 --> 21:58.800
Come on, you help out too, Masato!

21:58.800 --> 22:00.010
Y-Yeah.

22:00.400 --> 22:03.010
It's okay, just leave them there!

22:03.010 --> 22:04.260
